6 0 obj
<< /Length 951 >>
stream
BT
/F1 14.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 750.40 Tm (4.2 Raft) Tj
/F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 736.40 Tm (Raft splits the problem into leader election, log replication and safety.) Tj
/F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 722.40 Tm (A leader appends log entries and replicates them to followers before committing.) Tj
/F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 708.40 Tm (Randomized election timeouts and term numbers prevent split votes among candidates.) Tj
/F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 694.40 Tm (A candidate that collects votes from a majority becomes leader for that term.) Tj
/F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 680.40 Tm (The log matching property guarantees that two logs containing the same index and term are identical up to that point.) Tj
/F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 666.40 Tm (Membership changes are applied as special log entries so the configuration is itself replicated.) Tj
/F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 652.40 Tm (Snapshots compact the log and let a lagging follower catch up without replaying every entry.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
